.bezierCurveTo(p[1][0], p[1][1], p[2][0], p[2][1], p[3][0], p[3][1]); x.stroke(); }\n1165\tfunction wrapText(x, text, X, Y, maxW, lh) {\n1166\t  let line = '', y = Y;\n1167\t  for (const ch of text) {\n1168\t    if (x.measureText(line + ch).width > maxW && line) { x.fillText(line, X, y); line = ch; y += lh; } else line += ch;\n1169\t  }\n1170\t  if (line) x.fillText(line, X, y);\n1171\t  return y;\n1172\t}\n1173\tfunction tassel(x, X, Y, len, col) {\n1174\t  x.strokeStyle = col; x.lineWidth = 1.6;\n1175\t  for (let i = -2; i <= 2; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(X, Y); x.quadraticCurveTo(X + i * 2, Y + len * 0.5, X + i * 3.5, Y + len); x.stroke(); }\n1176\t  x.fillStyle = col; x.beginPath(); x.arc(X, Y, 3.5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1177\t}\n1178\t// 木刻風的主圖：墨填滿，再用卡底色刻出白線\n1179\tconst EMBLEM = {\n1180\t  sing(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 摺扇與聲紋\n1181\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3;\n1182\t    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy + s * 0.5, s * (1.08 + i * 0.15), Math.PI * 1.22, Math.PI * 1.78); x.stroke(); }\n1183\t    const px = cx, py = cy + s * 0.55, R = s * 0.98, a0 = Math.PI * 1.13, a1 = Math.PI * 1.87;\n1184\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(px, py); x.arc(px, py, R, a0, a1); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n1185\t    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2;\n1186\t    for (let i = 0; i <= 12; i++) { const a = a0 + (a1 - a0) * i / 12; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(px + Math.cos(a) * R * 0.28, py + Math.sin(a) * R * 0.28); x.lineTo(px + Math.cos(a) * R * 0.95, py + Math.sin(a) * R * 0.95); x.stroke(); }\n1187\t    x.lineWidth = 3; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, R * 0.6, a0 + 0.06, a1 - 0.06); x.stroke();\n1188\t    x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, R * 0.86, a0 + 0.04, a1 - 0.04); x.stroke();\n1189\t    // 扇面上的雲紋\n1190\t    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) { const a = a0 + (a1 - a0) * (0.25 + i * 0.25), r0 = R * 0.73; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px + Math.cos(a) * r0, py + Math.sin(a) * r0, 6, 0, Math.PI * 1.6); x.stroke(); }\n1191\t    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1192\t    tassel(x, px, py + 6, 42, P.carve);\n1193\t  },\n1194\t  speak(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 卷軸與醒木\n1195\t    const w = s * 0.92, h = s * 1.45, r = rng(5);\n1196\t    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2, cy - h / 2, w, h);\n1197\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.strokeRect(cx - w / 2 + 6, cy - h / 2 + 8, w - 12, h - 16);\n1198\t    x.lineCap = 'round';\n1199\t    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n1200\t      const lx = cx + w * 0.3 - i * w * 0.2;\n1201\t      for (let j = 0; j < 6; j++) { const y0 = cy - h / 2 + 20 + j * (h - 40) / 6; x.lineWidth = 3 + r() * 2; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(lx + (r() - 0.5) * 3, y0); x.lineTo(lx + (r() - 0.5) * 3, y0 + 8 + r() * 8); x.stroke(); }\n1202\t    }\n1203\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 - 12, cy - h / 2 - 12, w + 24, 13); x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 - 12, cy + h / 2 - 1, w + 24, 13);\n1204\t    [[-1, -1], [1, -1], [-1, 1], [1, 1]].forEach(([a, b]) => { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx + a * (w / 2 + 14), cy + b * (h / 2 + 5.5), 7, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill(); });\n1205\t    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 + 12, cy + h / 2 - 34, 18, 18);\n1206\t  },\n1207\t  act(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 水袖\n1208\t    const band = (p, w) => { x.lineCap = 'round'; x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = w; bez(x, p); x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = w * 0.5; bez(x, p); x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 1.6; bez(x, p); };\n1209\t    band([[cx - s * 0.6, cy + s * 0.85], [cx - s * 1.05, cy - s * 0.1], [cx + s * 0.75, cy + s * 0.2], [cx + s * 0.25, cy - s * 0.95]], 24);\n1210\t    band([[cx + s * 0.62, cy + s * 0.9], [cx + s * 1.05, cy - s * 0.05], [cx - s * 0.6, cy - s * 0.05], [cx - s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.9]], 17);\n1211\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.95, s * 0.7, s * 0.16, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1212\t    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.95, s * 0.55, s * 0.08, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke();\n1213\t  },\n1214\t  fight(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 靠旗與雙槍\n1215\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.95); x.lineTo(cx - s * 0.58, cy + s * 0.15); x.lineTo(cx + s * 0.58, cy + s * 0.15); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n1216\t    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.78); x.lineTo(cx - s * 0.44, cy + s * 0.06); x.lineTo(cx + s * 0.44, cy + s * 0.06); x.closePath(); x.stroke();\n1217\t    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy - s * 0.18 + i * 0.0, 6 + i * 6, Math.PI * 1.1, Math.PI * 1.9); x.stroke(); }\n1218\t    const spear = (x0, y0, x1, y1) => {\n1219\t      x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 7; x.lineCap = 'round'; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x0, y0); x.lineTo(x1, y1); x.stroke();\n1220\t      x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 1.6; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x0, y0); x.lineTo(x1, y1); x.stroke();\n1221\t      const a = Math.atan2(y1 - y0, x1 - x0), L = s * 0.32;\n1222\t      x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x1 + Math.cos(a) * L, y1 + Math.sin(a) * L); x.lineTo(x1 + Math.cos(a + 1.9) * 12, y1 + Math.sin(a + 1.9) * 12); x.lineTo(x1 + Math.cos(a - 1.9) * 12, y1 + Math.sin(a - 1.9) * 12); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n1223\t      tassel(x, x1 - Math.cos(a) * 6, y1 - Math.sin(a) * 6, 26, P.carve);\n1224\t    };\n1225\t    spear(cx - s * 0.9, cy + s * 1.0, cx + s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.72);\n1226\t    spear(cx + s * 0.9, cy + s * 1.0, cx - s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.72);\n1227\t  },\n1228\t  care(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 一碗熱湯\n1229\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3; x.lineCap = 'round';\n1230\t    for (let i = -1; i <= 1; i++) bez(x, [[cx + i * s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.15], [cx + i * s * 0.3 - 14, cy - s * 0.45], [cx + i * s * 0.3 + 14, cy - s * 0.6], [cx + i * s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.95]]);\n1231\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx - s * 0.9, cy); x.bezierCurveTo(cx - s * 0.85, cy + s * 0.75, cx + s * 0.85, cy + s * 0.75, cx + s * 0.9, cy); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n1232\t    x.fillRect(cx - s * 0.32, cy + s * 0.58, s * 0.64, s * 0.14);\n1233\t    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.9, s * 0.17, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1234\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n1235\t    x.fillStyle = 'rgba(120,70,40,.5)'; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + 2, s * 0.72, s * 0.1, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1236\t    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2;\n1237\t    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx - s * 0.5 + i * s * 0.25, cy + s * 0.32, 7, Math.PI, 0); x.stroke(); }\n1238\t  },\n1239\t  comp(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 一根竹竿挑兩盞燈\n1240\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 4; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx - s, cy - s * 0.85); x.lineTo(cx + s, cy - s * 0.95); x.stroke();\n1241\t    [-0.45, 0.45].forEach((d, i) => {\n1242\t      const lx = cx + d * s, ly = cy + s * 0.05 + i * 6;\n1243\t      x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(lx, cy - s * 0.88 - i * 4); x.lineTo(lx, ly - s * 0.52); x.stroke();\n1244\t      x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(lx - 14, ly - s * 0.56, 28, 9); x.fillRect(lx - 14, ly + s * 0.47, 28, 9);\n1245\t      x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(lx, ly, s * 0.36, s * 0.5, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1246\t      x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n1247\t      x.lineWidth = 1.4; for (let k = -2; k <= 2; k++) { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(lx, ly, Math.abs(k) * s * 0.09 + 0.5, s * 0.5, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n1248\t      tassel(x, lx, ly + s * 0.56, 26, P.line);\n1249\t    });\n1250\t  },\n1251\t  listen(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 月下靜水\n1252\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy - s * 0.35, s * 0.55, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1253\t    x.fillStyle = P.base; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx + s * 0.22, cy - s * 0.48, s * 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1254\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line;\n1255\t    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) { x.lineWidth = 3 - i * 0.5; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.62, s * (0.25 + i * 0.22), s * (0.06 + i * 0.05), 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n1256\t    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx - s * 0.75, cy + s * 0.15, 5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1257\t  },\n1258\t  labor(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 燈骨與竹篾\n1259\t    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3.5;\n1260\t    x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.62, s * 0.85, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke();\n1261\t    x.lineWidth = 2; for (let k = 1; k <= 3; k++) { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.62 * (1 - k * 0.27), s * 0.85, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n1262\t    [-0.5, 0, 0.5].forEach(d => { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + d * s * 0.85, s * 0.62 * Math.sqrt(1 - d * d), s * 0.08, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); });\n1263\t    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.globalAlpha = 0.85; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.85); x.bezierCurveTo(cx + s * 0.5, cy - s * 0.7, cx + s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.2, cx + s * 0.6, cy + s * 0.05); x.lineTo(cx, cy + s * 0.05); x.closePath(); x.fill(); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n1264\t    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(cx - 16, cy - s * 0.98, 32, 10); x.fillRect(cx - 16, cy + s * 0.86, 32, 10);\n1265\t  },\n1266\t};\n1267\t// 小卡只放四樣：族色、牌名與金、「接 → X」、背面牌名。字要在手牌這個大小就讀得清\n1268\tfunction clothLines(x, line, r) {\n1269\t  x.globalAlpha = 0.07; x.strokeStyle = line; x.lineWidth = 0.6;\n1270\t  for (let i = 0; i < CH; i += 3) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(0, i + r()); x.lineTo(CW, i + r()); x.stroke(); }\n1271\t  for (let i = 0; i < CW; i += 3) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(i + r(), 0); x.lineTo(i + r(), CH); x.stroke(); }\n1272\t  x.globalAlpha = 1;\n1273\t}\n1274\tfunction chip(x, cx, cy, rad, f, fg) {\n1275\t  x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy, rad, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n1276\t  x.strokeStyle = fg; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n1277\t  x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f4ecdc'; x.font = `${Math.round(rad * 1.3)}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'middle';\n1278\t  x.fillText(FAM[f].n, cx, cy + 2);\n1279\t}\n1280\t// 家常牌的正面：不上台，只寫背面是什麼\n1281\tfunction drawGiftFace(x, t) {\n1282\t  const tp = T[t], h = FAM[tp.f].home, r = rng(hash(t + 'g'));\n1283\t  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = '#d9cdb8'; x.fill();\n1284\t  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip(); clothLines(x, '#4a3f3a', r); x.restore();\n1285\t  x.strokeStyle = '#a8202b'; x.lineWidth = 4; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n1286\t  x.globalAlpha = 0.3; EMBLEM[h](x, CW / 2 - 4, 240, 52, { base: '#d9cdb8', line: '#1c1719', carve: '#d9cdb8', hi: '#a8202b' }); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n1287\t  x.fillStyle = '#1c1719'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n1288\t  x.font = '30px \"Noto Serif SC\", serif'; x.fillText('家常', CW / 2, 76);\n1289\t  x.font = '86px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(tp.n, CW / 2, 178);\n1290\t  x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.font = '34px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('不上台', CW / 2, 340);\n1291\t  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(28,23,25,.82)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n1292\t  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(`背 ${HOME[h].n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n1293\t}\n1294\tconst kwOf = tp => (tp.wild ? '百搭' : tp.heavy ? '重彩' : tp.fin ? `压轴+${tp.fin}` : tp.clean ? '素·不上妆' : tp.boost ? '托·连击×2' : '');\n1295\t// 這張牌後面接哪一族；百搭後面什麼都接得上\n1296\tconst nextN = tp => (tp.wild ? '任意' : FAM[tp.next].n);\n1297\tfunction drawStageFace(x, t) {\n1298\t  if (T[t].home) { drawGiftFace(x, t); return; }\n1299\t  const tp = T[t], f = tp.f, r = rng(hash(t)), fg = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f4ecdc', P = { base: FCOL[f], line: f === 'speak' ? '#0d0a0b' : '#1c1416', carve: '#efe2c8', hi: fg };\n1300\t  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.fill();\n1301\t  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip();\n1302\t  clothLines(x, fg, r);\n1303\t  const vg = x.createRadialGradient(CW / 2, CH / 2, CH * 0.25, CW / 2, CH / 2, CH * 0.72); vg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)'); vg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(10,3,5,.45)'); x.fillStyle = vg; x.fillRect(0, 0, CW, CH);\n1304\t  x.restore();\n1305\t  // 借來的牌：金邊\n1306\t  x.strokeStyle = tp.blank ? '#f2d48a' : fg; x.lineWidth = tp.blank ? 6 : 2.5; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n1307\t  x.globalAlpha = 0.34; EMBLEM[f](x, CW / 2 - 4, 232, 46, P); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n1308\t  // 族與金\n1309\t  chip(x, 62, 64, 32, f, fg);\n1310\t  x.fillStyle = fg; x.font = '30px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'right'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic'; x.fillText('金', CW - 76, 80);\n1311\t  x.font = '66px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'left'; x.fillText(String(tp.g), CW - 72, 88);\n1312\t  // 牌名\n1313\t  x.textAlign = 'center'; x.font = `${tp.n.length > 1 ? 74 : 96}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.fillText(tp.n, CW / 2, 182);\n1314\t  if (tp.blank) { x.font = '28px \"Noto Serif SC\", serif'; x.fillText('借', CW / 2, 216); }\n1315\t  // 後台的牌：一個詞說它強在哪\n1316\t  if (kwOf(tp)) {\n1317\t    x.font = '30px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; const kw = kwOf(tp), w = x.measureText(kw).width + 26;\n1318\t    x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f2d48a'; x.fillRect(CW / 2 - w / 2, 196, w, 36);\n1319\t    x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#f2d48a' : '#1c1719'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(kw, CW / 2, 215); x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n1320\t  }\n1321\t  // 接 → X\n1322\t  x.font = '44px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'left'; x.fillText('接', 56, 340);\n1323\t  x.lineWidth = 5; x.strokeStyle = fg; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(108, 325); x.lineTo(170, 325); x.lineTo(156, 313); x.moveTo(170, 325); x.lineTo(156, 337); x.stroke();\n1324\t  if (tp.wild) { x.font = '40px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.fillText('任意', 222, 340); } else chip(x, 214, 324, 36, tp.next, fg);\n1325\t  // 背面牌名\n1326\t  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(12,8,10,.5)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n1327\t  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'middle';\n1328\t  x.fillText(tp.blank ? '背 空白' : `背 ${HOME[FAM[f].home].n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n1329\t}\n1330\tfunction drawHomeFace(x, t, over) {\n1331\t  const tp = T[t], f = tp.f, h = FAM[f].home, r = rng(hash(t + 'h')), line = '#1c1719', P = { base: '#ebe2d3', line, carve: '#ebe2d3', hi: '#a8202b' };\n1332\t  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = tp.blank ? '#f4f0e8' : '#ebe2d3'; x.fill();\n1333\t  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip();\n1334\t  clothLines(x, line, r);\n1335\t  if (!tp.blank) for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) { const X = r() * CW, Y = r() * CH, Rd = 60 + r() * 120, g = x.createRadialGradient(X, Y, 0, X, Y, Rd); g.addColorStop(0, `rgba(60,52,54,${0.05 + r() * 0.12})`); g.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(60,52,54,0)'); x.fillStyle = g; x.fillRect(0, 0, CW, CH); }\n1336\t  x.restore();\n1337\t  x.strokeStyle = line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n1338\t  x.fillStyle = line; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n1339\t  if (tp.blank) {\n1340\t    x.globalAlpha = 0.25; x.font = '74px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('空白', CW / 2, 190); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n1341\t    x.font = '38px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('灯不涨', CW / 2, 340);\n1342\t  } else {\n1343\t    x.font = '74px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(HOME[h].n, CW / 2, 112);\n1344\t    EMBLEM[h](x, CW / 2 - 4, 216, 58, P);\n1345\t    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.font = '42px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(tp.home ? `${HOME[h].look} 算两张` : `${HOME[h].look} 记一张`, CW / 2, 348);\n1346\t  }\n1347\t  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(28,23,25,.82)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n1348\t  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(`面 ${tp.n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n1349\t  // 第三幕：台上面的字蓋住家裡面\n1350\t  if (over) {\n1351\t    x.save(); x.translate(CW / 2, 200); x.rotate(-0.16); x.globalAlpha = 0.92; x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.font = `${tp.n.length > 1 ? 112 : 150}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(tp.n, 0, 0); x.restore();\n1352\t  }\n1353\t}\n1354\tfunction drawCard(t, side, over) {\n1355\t  const c = document.createElement('canvas'); c.width = CW * 2; c.height = CH * 2;\n1356\t  const x = c.getContext('2d'); x.scale(2, 2);\n1357\t  if (side === 'home') drawHomeFace(x, t, over); else drawStageFace(x, t);\n1358\t  return c;\n1359\t}\n1360\tconst cardCache = {};\n1361\tfunction cardArt(t, side = 'stage', over = false) {\n1362\t  const k = `${t}|${side}|${over ? 1 : 0}`;\n1363\t  if (!cardCache[k]) { const c = drawCard(t, side, over); cardCache[k] = { c, url: c.toDataURL('image/png') }; }\n1364\t  return cardCache[k];\n1365\t}\n1366\t// 看牌的文字：每面最多三行，每行不超過 14 字（第八節）\n1367\tfunction stageLines(t) {\n1368\t  const tp = T[t];\n1369\t  if (tp.home) return ['家常牌，不上台。', '推给她，或拿来卸妆。'];\n1370\t  const kw = tp.wild ? '百搭：接谁都算接上，也能起手。' : tp.heavy ? '重彩：留两层油彩。' : tp.fin ? `压轴：第 4 张起打，再 +${tp.fin} 金。` : tp.clean ? '素：不上妆，脸上不添层。' : tp.boost ? '托：接上时，连击的金翻倍。' : '接上上一张，连击 +1。';\n1371\t  return [`打出得 ${tp.g} 金。`, kw, tp.wild ? '下一张打哪一族都接得上。' : `下一张请打：${FAM[tp.next].n}。`];\n1372\t}\n1373\tfunction homeLines(t) {\n1374\t  const tp = T[t], look = HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].look;\n1375\t  if (tp.blank) return ['背面是空白。', '推出去，灯不涨。'];\n1376\t  if (tp.home) return [`她「${look}」时：算两张，灯 +3。`, '有没擦的油彩，这张被染。'];\n1377\t  return [`她「${look}」时：记一张，灯 +2。`, '不对路灯不涨；被染留一道痕。'];\n1378\t}\n1379\t\n1380\t// ── 臉（鏡子、手邊小像、3D 頭上的貼圖共用）──────────────\n1381\tconst ZONES = [\n1382\t  [[-0.42, -0.06, 0.36, 0.3], [0.42, -0.06, 0.36, 0.3]],\n1383\t  [[-0.52, 0.28, 0.3, 0.3], [0.52, 0.28, 0.3, 0.3]],\n1384\t  [[0, -0.6, 0.55, 0.22]],\n1385\t  [[0, 0.06, 0.15, 0.48]],\n1386\t  [[0, 0.74, 0.58, 0.28]],\n1387\t  [[0, 0.02, 0.95, 1.15]],\n1388\t];\n1389\tfunction eye(x, ex, ey, r, d, mode, painted) {"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"737d43d7-3217-4b6e-a07b-b68e7bdbe8c6","uuid":"881d8dbb-8769-489f-8a9e-cfdfee4803c9","timestamp":"2026-11-11T14:39:08.547Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/tsun/Projects/game-dise/原型/v1.6/index.html","content":"const $ = s => document.querySelector(s);\nconst esc = s => String(s).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, ch => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' }[ch]));\nconst wait = ms => new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms));\nconst calm = () => matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\nfunction rng(a) {\n  return () => { a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6D2B79F5) | 0; let t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a); t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t; return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; };\n}\nconst hash = s => { let h = 2166136261; for (const ch of s) { h ^= ch.codePointAt(0); h = Math.imul(h, 16777619); } return h >>> 0; };\nconst hexRgb = h => { const n = parseInt(h.slice(1), 16); return `${n >> 16},${(n >> 8) & 255},${n & 255}`; };\nconst pick = a => a[Math.floor(Math.random() * a.length)];\n// 台上臉、布的顏色：唱紅、念墨、做土、打金\nconst FCOL = { sing: '#a8243a', speak: '#2b2427', act: '#8f6338', fight: '#b8913f' };\nconst SKIN = 0xf2e8de;\n\n// ── 卡面（2D，畫在 canvas 上；手牌和 3D 桌上的牌用同一張）────────\nconst CW = 300, CH = 450;\nfunction rr(x, X, Y, w, h, r) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(X + r, Y); x.arcTo(X + w, Y, X + w, Y + h, r); x.arcTo(X + w, Y + h, X, Y + h, r); x.arcTo(X, Y + h, X, Y, r); x.arcTo(X, Y, X + w, Y, r); x.closePath(); }\n// 塔羅式缺角框\nfunction notch(x, X, Y, w, h, r) {\n  x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(X + r, Y); x.lineTo(X + w - r, Y); x.arc(X + w, Y, r, Math.PI, Math.PI / 2, true);\n  x.lineTo(X + w, Y + h - r); x.arc(X + w, Y + h, r, Math.PI * 1.5, Math.PI, true);\n  x.lineTo(X + r, Y + h); x.arc(X, Y + h, r, 0, -Math.PI / 2, true);\n  x.lineTo(X, Y + r); x.arc(X, Y, r, Math.PI / 2, 0, true); x.closePath();\n}\nfunction bez(x, p) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(p[0][0], p[0][1]); x.bezierCurveTo(p[1][0], p[1][1], p[2][0], p[2][1], p[3][0], p[3][1]); x.stroke(); }\nfunction wrapText(x, text, X, Y, maxW, lh) {\n  let line = '', y = Y;\n  for (const ch of text) {\n    if (x.measureText(line + ch).width > maxW && line) { x.fillText(line, X, y); line = ch; y += lh; } else line += ch;\n  }\n  if (line) x.fillText(line, X, y);\n  return y;\n}\nfunction tassel(x, X, Y, len, col) {\n  x.strokeStyle = col; x.lineWidth = 1.6;\n  for (let i = -2; i <= 2; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(X, Y); x.quadraticCurveTo(X + i * 2, Y + len * 0.5, X + i * 3.5, Y + len); x.stroke(); }\n  x.fillStyle = col; x.beginPath(); x.arc(X, Y, 3.5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n}\n// 木刻風的主圖：墨填滿，再用卡底色刻出白線\nconst EMBLEM = {\n  sing(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 摺扇與聲紋\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy + s * 0.5, s * (1.08 + i * 0.15), Math.PI * 1.22, Math.PI * 1.78); x.stroke(); }\n    const px = cx, py = cy + s * 0.55, R = s * 0.98, a0 = Math.PI * 1.13, a1 = Math.PI * 1.87;\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(px, py); x.arc(px, py, R, a0, a1); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2;\n    for (let i = 0; i <= 12; i++) { const a = a0 + (a1 - a0) * i / 12; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(px + Math.cos(a) * R * 0.28, py + Math.sin(a) * R * 0.28); x.lineTo(px + Math.cos(a) * R * 0.95, py + Math.sin(a) * R * 0.95); x.stroke(); }\n    x.lineWidth = 3; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, R * 0.6, a0 + 0.06, a1 - 0.06); x.stroke();\n    x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, R * 0.86, a0 + 0.04, a1 - 0.04); x.stroke();\n    // 扇面上的雲紋\n    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) { const a = a0 + (a1 - a0) * (0.25 + i * 0.25), r0 = R * 0.73; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px + Math.cos(a) * r0, py + Math.sin(a) * r0, 6, 0, Math.PI * 1.6); x.stroke(); }\n    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    tassel(x, px, py + 6, 42, P.carve);\n  },\n  speak(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 卷軸與醒木\n    const w = s * 0.92, h = s * 1.45, r = rng(5);\n    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2, cy - h / 2, w, h);\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.strokeRect(cx - w / 2 + 6, cy - h / 2 + 8, w - 12, h - 16);\n    x.lineCap = 'round';\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n      const lx = cx + w * 0.3 - i * w * 0.2;\n      for (let j = 0; j < 6; j++) { const y0 = cy - h / 2 + 20 + j * (h - 40) / 6; x.lineWidth = 3 + r() * 2; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(lx + (r() - 0.5) * 3, y0); x.lineTo(lx + (r() - 0.5) * 3, y0 + 8 + r() * 8); x.stroke(); }\n    }\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 - 12, cy - h / 2 - 12, w + 24, 13); x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 - 12, cy + h / 2 - 1, w + 24, 13);\n    [[-1, -1], [1, -1], [-1, 1], [1, 1]].forEach(([a, b]) => { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx + a * (w / 2 + 14), cy + b * (h / 2 + 5.5), 7, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill(); });\n    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.fillRect(cx - w / 2 + 12, cy + h / 2 - 34, 18, 18);\n  },\n  act(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 水袖\n    const band = (p, w) => { x.lineCap = 'round'; x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = w; bez(x, p); x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = w * 0.5; bez(x, p); x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 1.6; bez(x, p); };\n    band([[cx - s * 0.6, cy + s * 0.85], [cx - s * 1.05, cy - s * 0.1], [cx + s * 0.75, cy + s * 0.2], [cx + s * 0.25, cy - s * 0.95]], 24);\n    band([[cx + s * 0.62, cy + s * 0.9], [cx + s * 1.05, cy - s * 0.05], [cx - s * 0.6, cy - s * 0.05], [cx - s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.9]], 17);\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.95, s * 0.7, s * 0.16, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.95, s * 0.55, s * 0.08, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke();\n  },\n  fight(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 靠旗與雙槍\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.95); x.lineTo(cx - s * 0.58, cy + s * 0.15); x.lineTo(cx + s * 0.58, cy + s * 0.15); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.78); x.lineTo(cx - s * 0.44, cy + s * 0.06); x.lineTo(cx + s * 0.44, cy + s * 0.06); x.closePath(); x.stroke();\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy - s * 0.18 + i * 0.0, 6 + i * 6, Math.PI * 1.1, Math.PI * 1.9); x.stroke(); }\n    const spear = (x0, y0, x1, y1) => {\n      x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 7; x.lineCap = 'round'; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x0, y0); x.lineTo(x1, y1); x.stroke();\n      x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 1.6; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x0, y0); x.lineTo(x1, y1); x.stroke();\n      const a = Math.atan2(y1 - y0, x1 - x0), L = s * 0.32;\n      x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(x1 + Math.cos(a) * L, y1 + Math.sin(a) * L); x.lineTo(x1 + Math.cos(a + 1.9) * 12, y1 + Math.sin(a + 1.9) * 12); x.lineTo(x1 + Math.cos(a - 1.9) * 12, y1 + Math.sin(a - 1.9) * 12); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n      tassel(x, x1 - Math.cos(a) * 6, y1 - Math.sin(a) * 6, 26, P.carve);\n    };\n    spear(cx - s * 0.9, cy + s * 1.0, cx + s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.72);\n    spear(cx + s * 0.9, cy + s * 1.0, cx - s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.72);\n  },\n  care(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 一碗熱湯\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3; x.lineCap = 'round';\n    for (let i = -1; i <= 1; i++) bez(x, [[cx + i * s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.15], [cx + i * s * 0.3 - 14, cy - s * 0.45], [cx + i * s * 0.3 + 14, cy - s * 0.6], [cx + i * s * 0.3, cy - s * 0.95]]);\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx - s * 0.9, cy); x.bezierCurveTo(cx - s * 0.85, cy + s * 0.75, cx + s * 0.85, cy + s * 0.75, cx + s * 0.9, cy); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n    x.fillRect(cx - s * 0.32, cy + s * 0.58, s * 0.64, s * 0.14);\n    x.fillStyle = P.carve; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.9, s * 0.17, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n    x.fillStyle = 'rgba(120,70,40,.5)'; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + 2, s * 0.72, s * 0.1, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.carve; x.lineWidth = 2;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) { x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx - s * 0.5 + i * s * 0.25, cy + s * 0.32, 7, Math.PI, 0); x.stroke(); }\n  },\n  comp(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 一根竹竿挑兩盞燈\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 4; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx - s, cy - s * 0.85); x.lineTo(cx + s, cy - s * 0.95); x.stroke();\n    [-0.45, 0.45].forEach((d, i) => {\n      const lx = cx + d * s, ly = cy + s * 0.05 + i * 6;\n      x.lineWidth = 1.5; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(lx, cy - s * 0.88 - i * 4); x.lineTo(lx, ly - s * 0.52); x.stroke();\n      x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(lx - 14, ly - s * 0.56, 28, 9); x.fillRect(lx - 14, ly + s * 0.47, 28, 9);\n      x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(lx, ly, s * 0.36, s * 0.5, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n      x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n      x.lineWidth = 1.4; for (let k = -2; k <= 2; k++) { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(lx, ly, Math.abs(k) * s * 0.09 + 0.5, s * 0.5, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n      tassel(x, lx, ly + s * 0.56, 26, P.line);\n    });\n  },\n  listen(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 月下靜水\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy - s * 0.35, s * 0.55, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    x.fillStyle = P.base; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx + s * 0.22, cy - s * 0.48, s * 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) { x.lineWidth = 3 - i * 0.5; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + s * 0.62, s * (0.25 + i * 0.22), s * (0.06 + i * 0.05), 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx - s * 0.75, cy + s * 0.15, 5, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n  },\n  labor(x, cx, cy, s, P) { // 燈骨與竹篾\n    x.strokeStyle = P.line; x.lineWidth = 3.5;\n    x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.62, s * 0.85, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke();\n    x.lineWidth = 2; for (let k = 1; k <= 3; k++) { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy, s * 0.62 * (1 - k * 0.27), s * 0.85, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); }\n    [-0.5, 0, 0.5].forEach(d => { x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(cx, cy + d * s * 0.85, s * 0.62 * Math.sqrt(1 - d * d), s * 0.08, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.stroke(); });\n    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.globalAlpha = 0.85; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(cx, cy - s * 0.85); x.bezierCurveTo(cx + s * 0.5, cy - s * 0.7, cx + s * 0.62, cy - s * 0.2, cx + s * 0.6, cy + s * 0.05); x.lineTo(cx, cy + s * 0.05); x.closePath(); x.fill(); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n    x.fillStyle = P.line; x.fillRect(cx - 16, cy - s * 0.98, 32, 10); x.fillRect(cx - 16, cy + s * 0.86, 32, 10);\n  },\n};\n// 小卡只放四樣：族色、牌名與金、「接 → X」、背面牌名。字要在手牌這個大小就讀得清\nfunction clothLines(x, line, r) {\n  x.globalAlpha = 0.07; x.strokeStyle = line; x.lineWidth = 0.6;\n  for (let i = 0; i < CH; i += 3) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(0, i + r()); x.lineTo(CW, i + r()); x.stroke(); }\n  for (let i = 0; i < CW; i += 3) { x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(i + r(), 0); x.lineTo(i + r(), CH); x.stroke(); }\n  x.globalAlpha = 1;\n}\nfunction chip(x, cx, cy, rad, f, fg) {\n  x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.beginPath(); x.arc(cx, cy, rad, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n  x.strokeStyle = fg; x.lineWidth = 2.5; x.stroke();\n  x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f4ecdc'; x.font = `${Math.round(rad * 1.3)}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'middle';\n  x.fillText(FAM[f].n, cx, cy + 2);\n}\n// 家常牌的正面：不上台，只寫背面是什麼\nfunction drawGiftFace(x, t) {\n  const tp = T[t], h = FAM[tp.f].home, r = rng(hash(t + 'g'));\n  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = '#d9cdb8'; x.fill();\n  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip(); clothLines(x, '#4a3f3a', r); x.restore();\n  x.strokeStyle = '#a8202b'; x.lineWidth = 4; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n  x.globalAlpha = 0.3; EMBLEM[h](x, CW / 2 - 4, 240, 52, { base: '#d9cdb8', line: '#1c1719', carve: '#d9cdb8', hi: '#a8202b' }); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n  x.fillStyle = '#1c1719'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n  x.font = '30px \"Noto Serif SC\", serif'; x.fillText('家常', CW / 2, 76);\n  x.font = '86px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(tp.n, CW / 2, 178);\n  x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.font = '34px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('不上台', CW / 2, 340);\n  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(28,23,25,.82)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(`背 ${HOME[h].n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n}\nconst kwOf = tp => (tp.wild ? '百搭' : tp.heavy ? '重彩' : tp.fin ? `压轴+${tp.fin}` : tp.clean ? '素·不上妆' : tp.boost ? '托·连击×2' : '');\n// 這張牌後面接哪一族；百搭後面什麼都接得上\nconst nextN = tp => (tp.wild ? '任意' : FAM[tp.next].n);\nfunction drawStageFace(x, t) {\n  if (T[t].home) { drawGiftFace(x, t); return; }\n  const tp = T[t], f = tp.f, r = rng(hash(t)), fg = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f4ecdc', P = { base: FCOL[f], line: f === 'speak' ? '#0d0a0b' : '#1c1416', carve: '#efe2c8', hi: fg };\n  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.fill();\n  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip();\n  clothLines(x, fg, r);\n  const vg = x.createRadialGradient(CW / 2, CH / 2, CH * 0.25, CW / 2, CH / 2, CH * 0.72); vg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)'); vg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(10,3,5,.45)'); x.fillStyle = vg; x.fillRect(0, 0, CW, CH);\n  x.restore();\n  // 借來的牌：金邊\n  x.strokeStyle = tp.blank ? '#f2d48a' : fg; x.lineWidth = tp.blank ? 6 : 2.5; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n  x.globalAlpha = 0.34; EMBLEM[f](x, CW / 2 - 4, 232, 46, P); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n  // 族與金\n  chip(x, 62, 64, 32, f, fg);\n  x.fillStyle = fg; x.font = '30px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'right'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic'; x.fillText('金', CW - 76, 80);\n  x.font = '66px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'left'; x.fillText(String(tp.g), CW - 72, 88);\n  // 牌名\n  x.textAlign = 'center'; x.font = `${tp.n.length > 1 ? 74 : 96}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.fillText(tp.n, CW / 2, 182);\n  if (tp.blank) { x.font = '28px \"Noto Serif SC\", serif'; x.fillText('借', CW / 2, 216); }\n  // 後台的牌：一個詞說它強在哪\n  if (kwOf(tp)) {\n    x.font = '30px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; const kw = kwOf(tp), w = x.measureText(kw).width + 26;\n    x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#1c1719' : '#f2d48a'; x.fillRect(CW / 2 - w / 2, 196, w, 36);\n    x.fillStyle = f === 'fight' ? '#f2d48a' : '#1c1719'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(kw, CW / 2, 215); x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n  }\n  // 接 → X\n  x.font = '44px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'left'; x.fillText('接', 56, 340);\n  x.lineWidth = 5; x.strokeStyle = fg; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(108, 325); x.lineTo(170, 325); x.lineTo(156, 313); x.moveTo(170, 325); x.lineTo(156, 337); x.stroke();\n  if (tp.wild) { x.font = '40px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.fillText('任意', 222, 340); } else chip(x, 214, 324, 36, tp.next, fg);\n  // 背面牌名\n  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(12,8,10,.5)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'middle';\n  x.fillText(tp.blank ? '背 空白' : `背 ${HOME[FAM[f].home].n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n}\nfunction drawHomeFace(x, t, over) {\n  const tp = T[t], f = tp.f, h = FAM[f].home, r = rng(hash(t + 'h')), line = '#1c1719', P = { base: '#ebe2d3', line, carve: '#ebe2d3', hi: '#a8202b' };\n  rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.fillStyle = tp.blank ? '#f4f0e8' : '#ebe2d3'; x.fill();\n  x.save(); rr(x, 0, 0, CW, CH, 16); x.clip();\n  clothLines(x, line, r);\n  if (!tp.blank) for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) { const X = r() * CW, Y = r() * CH, Rd = 60 + r() * 120, g = x.createRadialGradient(X, Y, 0, X, Y, Rd); g.addColorStop(0, `rgba(60,52,54,${0.05 + r() * 0.12})`); g.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(60,52,54,0)'); x.fillStyle = g; x.fillRect(0, 0, CW, CH); }\n  x.restore();\n  x.strokeStyle = line; x.lineWidth = 2.5; notch(x, 14, 14, CW - 28, CH - 28, 20); x.stroke();\n  x.fillStyle = line; x.textAlign = 'center'; x.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n  if (tp.blank) {\n    x.globalAlpha = 0.25; x.font = '74px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('空白', CW / 2, 190); x.globalAlpha = 1;\n    x.font = '38px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText('灯不涨', CW / 2, 340);\n  } else {\n    x.font = '74px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(HOME[h].n, CW / 2, 112);\n    EMBLEM[h](x, CW / 2 - 4, 216, 58, P);\n    x.fillStyle = '#a8202b'; x.font = '42px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.fillText(tp.home ? `${HOME[h].look} 算两张` : `${HOME[h].look} 记一张`, CW / 2, 348);\n  }\n  x.fillStyle = 'rgba(28,23,25,.82)'; x.fillRect(28, 374, CW - 56, 46);\n  x.fillStyle = '#f4ecdc'; x.font = '32px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif'; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(`面 ${tp.n}`, CW / 2, 398);\n  // 第三幕：台上面的字蓋住家裡面\n  if (over) {\n    x.save(); x.translate(CW / 2, 200); x.rotate(-0.16); x.globalAlpha = 0.92; x.fillStyle = FCOL[f]; x.font = `${tp.n.length > 1 ? 112 : 150}px \"Ma Shan Zheng\", serif`; x.textBaseline = 'middle'; x.fillText(tp.n, 0, 0); x.restore();\n  }\n}\nfunction drawCard(t, side, over) {\n  const c = document.createElement('canvas'); c.width = CW * 2; c.height = CH * 2;\n  const x = c.getContext('2d'); x.scale(2, 2);\n  if (side === 'home') drawHomeFace(x, t, over); else drawStageFace(x, t);\n  return c;\n}\nconst cardCache = {};\nfunction cardArt(t, side = 'stage', over = false) {\n  const k = `${t}|${side}|${over ? 1 : 0}`;\n  if (!cardCache[k]) { const c = drawCard(t, side, over); cardCache[k] = { c, url: c.toDataURL('image/png') }; }\n  return cardCache[k];\n}\n// 看牌的文字：每面最多三行，每行不超過 14 字（第八節）\nfunction stageLines(t) {\n  const tp = T[t];\n  if (tp.home) return ['家常牌，不上台。', '推给她，或拿来卸妆。'];\n  const kw = tp.wild ? '百搭：接谁都算接上，也能起手。' : tp.heavy ? '重彩：留两层油彩。' : tp.fin ? `压轴：第 4 张起打，再 +${tp.fin} 金。` : tp.clean ? '素：不上妆，脸上不添层。' : tp.boost ? '托：接上时，连击的金翻倍。' : '接上上一张，连击 +1。';\n  return [`打出得 ${tp.g} 金。`, kw, tp.wild ? '下一张打哪一族都接得上。' : `下一张请打：${FAM[tp.next].n}。`];\n}\nfunction homeLines(t) {\n  const tp = T[t], look = HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].look;\n  if (tp.blank) return ['背面是空白。', '推出去，灯不涨。'];\n  if (tp.home) return [`她「${look}」时：算两张，灯 +3。`, '有没擦的油彩，这张被染。'];\n  return [`她「${look}」时：记一张，灯 +2。`, '不对路灯不涨；被染留一道痕。'];\n}\n\n// ── 臉（鏡子、手邊小像、3D 頭上的貼圖共用）──────────────\nconst ZONES = [\n  [[-0.42, -0.06, 0.36, 0.3], [0.42, -0.06, 0.36, 0.3]],\n  [[-0.52, 0.28, 0.3, 0.3], [0.52, 0.28, 0.3, 0.3]],\n  [[0, -0.6, 0.55, 0.22]],\n  [[0, 0.06, 0.15, 0.48]],\n  [[0, 0.74, 0.58, 0.28]],\n  [[0, 0.02, 0.95, 1.15]],\n];\nfunction eye(x, ex, ey, r, d, mode, painted) {","numLines":250,"startLine":1140,"totalLines":3649}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015CCsT1i6w4JsZmP7yTSfEN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
